        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part VI, Section A, Line 4</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>EFFECTIVE APRIL 2, 2025, SAN DIEGO SOCIAL VENTURE PARTNERS, INC. AMENDED ITS ARTICLES OF INCORPORATION AND CHANGED ITS NAME TO AMPLIFIED IMPACT PARTNERS.</ExplanationTxt>
