      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Form 990, Part VI, Section A, Line 6</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>AMPLIFIED has one class of members (partners). Member partners are required to make an annual minimum contribution of at least $1,500. Membership donations, along with professional expertise and networks, are leveraged to gain greater impact.</ExplanationTxt>
